    single 4-connected component
    density: 0.60-0.71 of bbox (rest are bg holes)
    every row and column of bbox contains >=1 mask pixel
  palette:
    shape: 3 rows x W cols where W = mask bbox width
    row 0 and row 1 identical (column-color pattern of 4-5 contiguous runs, run length 1-3)
    row 2 uniform single hole_color
    3-5 distinct column colors, all different from bg, mask_color, and hole_color
